step	1	5	Penguin spotting
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Larry</col> at the <col=800000>Ardougne Zoo</col> thinks the penguins are up to something. He wants me to help him build a <col=800000>bird hide</col> on the <col=800000>iceberg</col> so we can watch them.</col>
line	<col=000080>I need <col=800000>10 oak planks</col>, <col=800000>10 steel nails</col>, a <col=800000>hammer</col> and a <col=800000>spade</col>. Larry will meet me at the dock north-east of <col=800000>Rellekka</col>.</col>
step	2	10	Building the hide
line	<str>Larry at the Ardougne Zoo thinks the penguins are up to something. He wants me to help him build a bird hide on the iceberg so we can watch them.</str>
line	<str>I need 10 oak planks, 10 steel nails, a hammer and a spade. Larry will meet me at the dock north-east of Rellekka.</str>
line	<col=000080>Larry sailed me to the iceberg. I should build the hide on the <col=800000>firm snow patch</col> with my planks, then dig snow over it with my spade.</col>
step	3	15	Hello world!
line	<str>Larry at the Ardougne Zoo thinks the penguins are up to something. He wants me to help him build a bird hide on the iceberg so we can watch them.</str>
line	<str>I need 10 oak planks, 10 steel nails, a hammer and a spade. Larry will meet me at the dock north-east of Rellekka.</str>
line	<str>Larry sailed me to the iceberg. I should build the hide on the firm snow patch with my planks, then dig snow over it with my spade.</str>
line	<col=000080>From the hide I watched two penguins greet each other with three emotes. I should remember them, then talk to <col=800000>Larry</col>.</col>
step	4	18	Back to Rellekka
line	<str>Larry at the Ardougne Zoo thinks the penguins are up to something. He wants me to help him build a bird hide on the iceberg so we can watch them.</str>
line	<str>I need 10 oak planks, 10 steel nails, a hammer and a spade. Larry will meet me at the dock north-east of Rellekka.</str>
line	<str>Larry sailed me to the iceberg. I should build the hide on the firm snow patch with my planks, then dig snow over it with my spade.</str>
line	<str>From the hide I watched two penguins greet each other with three emotes. I should remember them, then talk to Larry.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Larry</col> is convinced the penguins are planning something. I should take the boat back to <col=800000>Rellekka</col> and speak to him on the dock.</col>
step	5	20	Clockwork penguin
line	<str>Larry at the Ardougne Zoo thinks the penguins are up to something. He wants me to help him build a bird hide on the iceberg so we can watch them.</str>
line	<str>I need 10 oak planks, 10 steel nails, a hammer and a spade. Larry will meet me at the dock north-east of Rellekka.</str>
line	<str>Larry sailed me to the iceberg. I should build the hide on the firm snow patch with my planks, then dig snow over it with my spade.</str>
line	<str>From the hide I watched two penguins greet each other with three emotes. I should remember them, then talk to Larry.</str>
line	<str>Larry is convinced the penguins are planning something. I should take the boat back to Rellekka and speak to him on the dock.</str>
line	<col=000080>Larry gave me a <col=800000>clockwork book</col>. I need to build a <col=800000>clockwork penguin</col> at a <col=800000>crafting table</col> in my house, then make a <col=800000>penguin suit</col> with it, a <col=800000>plank</col> and <col=800000>silk</col>, and bring it to Larry.</col>
step	6	25	Suit up!
line	<str>Larry at the Ardougne Zoo thinks the penguins are up to something. He wants me to help him build a bird hide on the iceberg so we can watch them.</str>
line	<str>I need 10 oak planks, 10 steel nails, a hammer and a spade. Larry will meet me at the dock north-east of Rellekka.</str>
line	<str>Larry sailed me to the iceberg. I should build the hide on the firm snow patch with my planks, then dig snow over it with my spade.</str>
line	<str>From the hide I watched two penguins greet each other with three emotes. I should remember them, then talk to Larry.</str>
line	<str>Larry is convinced the penguins are planning something. I should take the boat back to Rellekka and speak to him on the dock.</str>
line	<str>Larry gave me a clockwork book. I need to build a clockwork penguin at a crafting table in my house, then make a penguin suit with it, a plank and silk, and bring it to Larry.</str>
line	<col=000080>I have the penguin suit. <col=800000>Larry</col> wants to test it on the penguins in the <col=800000>Ardougne Zoo</col>.</col>
